You have omitted the third case: that of a non-randomly generated wand
which is of a random type, possibly wishing. Each level of Sokoban
contains a random wand, as does the titan variant of Medusa's
level. The Valley of the Dead contains two random wands. And should a
wand shop be generated, 90% of its non-mimic stock will be wands;
there's a 30% chance that the Alley Town version of Minetown will have
a wand shop, or they can be generated randomly in the main dungeon (3%
chance of a small shop being a wand shop).

(The fourth case, naturally, is wands found in bones files; how many
wishes will be _left_ in such wands depends on the sort of players you
share your bones with.)

